Fixed all findings:

- `src/logging.rs`: timestamps now come from the shared `runtime::current_instant()` clock (including the wasm host clock); `libc::write` retries on `EINTR`.
- `src/wasm.rs` + `src/interpreter.rs`: capture membership is thread-scoped and inherited by the interpreter thread, so another run/thread cannot collect logging or `say` output.
- `tests/stdlib_modules_test.rs`: added a readerless-pipe `EPIPE` catchability test.
- `SPEC.md`: logging example now uses `stdout` instead of writing `app.log`.
- Reports updated; no gates weakened.

